factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The draft's slides_spec and reel_script say the camp was organised 'by the Namakkal block horticulture department and ATMA scheme' — the article says it was held jointly by the horticulture department and the Technology Management Agency (தொழில்நுட்ப மேலாண் முகமை); calling it the ATMA scheme is a slight mismatch but acceptable only if equivalent; however, the caption and reel_script also say 'அட்மா திட்டம்' correctly, so this is minor.
  The draft says 'ஒருநாள் பயிற்சி' is held at the agricultural science station — accurate; but the slides say 'இளைஞர்களுக்கு மானியம்' (subsidy for youth) as the headline, while the article says subsidies exist in mushroom cultivation generally, not specifically for youth — an unsupported specific claim.
  The reel_script says 'வல்லுனர்கள் நுணுக்கங்களை விளக்கினர்' and 'நுணுக்கங்கள் குறித்து தொழில் முனைவோருடன் கலந்துரையாடினார்' — the article says Ilavarasan discussed with entrepreneurs; the reel_script attributes this to the expert 'இளவரசன்' only in one place and the caption omits the 'சமவெளியில்' (plains) detail; not a factual error but the 'மொட்டு காளான்' and nuance are unevenly represented.
  The reel_script omits the key fact that the article describes the camp being chaired/attended by named officials and that Yuvasenthilkumar welcomed attendees; this is not a critical omission.
